and said to them, You

          {+}
         are the heads of the fathers' [houses] of the Levites: sanctify yourselves, both you

          {+}
         and your

          {+}
         brothers, that you

          {+}
         may bring up the ark of Yahweh, the God of Israel, to [the place] that I have prepared for it.

For because you

          {+}
